[
  {
    "id": "daily-01",
    "text": "我一有在意的事，就会忍不住一直想。",
    "category": "curiosity",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-02",
    "text": "传说故事真奇妙呀。到底有多少是真的呢？",
    "category": "curiosity",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-03",
    "text": "还有好多好多事情是我不知道的吧。",
    "category": "curiosity",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-04",
    "text": "想着在意的事，回过神来时间就过去了。",
    "category": "curiosity",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-05",
    "text": "活了几百年的树都看过怎样的风景呢？",
    "category": "curiosity",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-06",
    "text": "虽然我是鬼，但也不是所有鬼都很可怕呀。",
    "category": "oni",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-07",
    "text": "我想成为帅气的鬼，不过被夸可爱也很开心。",
    "category": "oni",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-08",
    "text": "其实我有点怕黑。",
    "category": "oni",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-09",
    "text": "听到可怕的鬼故事，我也会紧张起来。",
    "category": "oni",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-10",
    "text": "虽然鬼听起来很吓人，但我更喜欢悠闲自在。",
    "category": "oni",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-11",
    "text": "看着树叶摇曳，我总觉得很喜欢。",
    "category": "nature",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-12",
    "text": "仔细听的话，森林里有各种各样的声音。",
    "category": "nature",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-13",
    "text": "看到高大的树，我就会忍不住抬头看。",
    "category": "nature",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-14",
    "text": "听着风声，心情就会平静下来。",
    "category": "nature",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-15",
    "text": "季节变了，同一个地方看起来也会不一样吗？",
    "category": "nature",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-16",
    "text": "我刚才在想什么来着……咦，是什么呢？",
    "category": "oops",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-17",
    "text": "发着呆，不知不觉又自言自语了。",
    "category": "oops",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-18",
    "text": "一想事情，有时连自己在想什么都会忘记。",
    "category": "oops",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-19",
    "text": "本来想说点帅气的话，却什么也没想到。",
    "category": "oops",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-20",
    "text": "嗯，今天想些什么好呢……啊，我又开始想事情了。",
    "category": "oops",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-21",
    "text": "什么也不做的时光，其实也挺奢侈的呢。",
    "category": "calm",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-22",
    "text": "我也很喜欢悠闲自在的时光。",
    "category": "calm",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-23",
    "text": "偶尔不慌不忙地度过也不错呢。",
    "category": "calm",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-24",
    "text": "希望大家都能找到自己喜欢的东西。",
    "category": "calm",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "daily-25",
    "text": "快乐说不定就藏在不起眼的小事里呢。",
    "category": "calm",
    "enabled": true,
    "weight": 1
  }
]
